codex
The control-flow rewrite is substantially closer, but it is not faithful. The largest remaining semantic problem is now post-trace: OpenMS recomputes trace m/z from the actual peaks, whereas the integer path stores the search centroid, then fabricates every EPD peak at that one m/z. I’m finishing the boundary/banding analysis and turning this into the five requested sections with SET/COORD/ORDER labels.
